Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-joblib, python3-paho-mqtt, python3-pydantic (>= 2.0), python3-serial, python3-sklearn, adduser, mosquitto
Description: HealthKicks local Raspberry Pi edge agent (healthkicks_edge)
 Local edge agent for Arduino IMU and haptic actuator communication.
 Performs local anomaly detection and communicates with a Mosquitto MQTT broker,
 bridged to AWS IoT Core via the packaged Mosquitto configuration.
